#X text 240 323 @slice FROM: Selects all pixels starting from FROM.
If FROM is a negative value \, it indicates the position of the pixel
from the end. For example: @slice -2 will select the last two pixels.;
#X text 240 393 @slice FROM TO: Selects all pixels starting from FROM
